Damn. Not again :( YAAD. However, by FAR my best game so far, i guess
i just got a little cocky.

Up until this point, my best game inluded me doing mines/soko, finding
the quest level but being to low Xlvl to start it, and dying not long
after. Not even starting the quest.

This time however, cleared mines, down to minetown, did soko, back up
to minesend which was the cellar version, used one of about 15 (at the
time) holy waters to make sure my luckstone was blessed. When i was
level 11, i came across a lovely little wraith. Killing it gave me the
xp to get to 12, and i was pleased to see it left a corpse. so now i
was only 1 level short, managed to get the level needed by clearing
out ludios which was my first time there as well... and was very fun,
and then I started the quest, and due to being a valk, completed it no
problems.

Went down, beat medusa INSTANTLY after clearing out her level. Picked
up a couple of nice potions there. Found a nice zoo in between medusa
and the castle, after a couple of maze levels, where i gained TC (one
of the few intrinsics i didn't already have having been crowned just
before doing the quest and from various corpses)

Went down to castle, I hadn't had an instrument for most of the game,
and had put one i did find in one of my BoHs. And i had forgotten I
had it. So went round the back. Cleared all the dragons. was happy
with my armor, so only used the armour to replace my "thoroughly burnt
+0 leather gloves" for some "+0 leaher gloves" just for the extra AC
point :p

Having not remembered I had an instrument stashed away, i went into
the zoo from the back. And had a LOT of soldiers straight on me.
Fought a few off, as well as a few other monsters. Including a
cockatrice...

Now... guess what one of the soldiers picked up and wielded? and guess
who was too excited with how well he was doing, to not realize he was
getting stoned?

Looks like i've learned (again) the hard way, not to get too cocky, or
too happy with how I am doing in the middle of a game.

